Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 21:12:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] umi: X55 modem probe on PCIe2 - PMX55 warm reset, AP2MDM
 status, PCIe2 link, endpoint ID, MHI/BHI registers (sweetmdm=N) (0260)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
